,50,128,20]],"links":[["Kiowa County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/kiowa-county"],["ARC or PLC in Kiowa County","/arc-plc/colorado/kiowa-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September ran 160% of normal and January to February ran 54%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 12% of normal, and grid 22006 had its driest year in 2002 at 38%.</p>"}
